# Environment — .env.example documents SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY and
# CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET and invites `cp .env.example .env`. Next loads `.env`,
# so without this a single `git add -A` commits live service credentials.
.env
.env*.local

